{"title":"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 30","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/5/2e587db84b04be626cffa624f6e05b7668b8b0f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}2=a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/c/d7ce5125f986b9765096faba73453805a41ac73c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}3=b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/b/56b82c0b3c6742ca81f6fbb29eee8b9804f4de07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{5}12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"19\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/0/440cea3b625a0dbe17e5f5cd016c7b0efa8fdf59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{a+b}{1+a}\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{2a+b}{1+a}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{a+2b}{1+a}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{2a+b}{1-a}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{a+2b}{1-a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"561\" height=\"41\" />   \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Change_of_base_formula\" title=\"Change of base formula\">change of base formula</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/75439ab528371b9416652d244c32eaf01809987b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{5}12 = \\frac{\\log_{10}12}{\\log_{10}5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"137\" height=\"42\" />.\n</p><p>For the numerator, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/9/c09e1ad2b9a07a9250153d03150bce3646148b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 3 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"95\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/4/2c4a176da135e9e88f14171e47340775fea0074f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}12 = \\log_{10}2 + \\log_{10}2 + \\log_{10}3 = 2a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"349\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>For the denominator, note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/9/ee914499039ce6bc0f0efabe52b90b2a5ec91f44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}10 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"91\" height=\"17\" />.  Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/c/9cc8864f406675388fdda1f56d7b3853734fa1ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}5 = \\log_{10}10 - \\log_{10}2 = 1 - a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"269\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, the fraction is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/a/b9a0abb3d261d387326cad08a3310af5c1925b3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2a+b}{1-a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"51\" height=\"38\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693c4044f8526a8179956e8ac7a3f2f9d61e2c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME\" title=\"1961 AHSME\">1961 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1961 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1961\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">Problem 29</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">Problem 31</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/